    "notes": "FY2020/FY2022 to FY2025 annual figures. FCF CAGRs are on owner FCF (reported FCF less SBC less award-tax withholding; no interest strip, net debt): FY2020 738.9, FY2022 514.5, FY2025 1,326.6. Owner and reported FCF CAGRs are close, so SBC is not outgrowing cash flow. Equity growth is flattered by stock issued for acquisitions, and all of the revenue CAGRs include acquired revenue; the forward paths are organic and are set from backlog and guidance, not from these CAGRs. FY2026 guided revenue growth is ~45.5%."
