    "wacc_rationale": "USD flows. Risk-free ~4.3% (10-year UST) + 5.0% ERP x beta ~1.1 gives a cost of equity near 9.8%; debt is ~5% of enterprise value at a ~5.5% pre-tax cost, so WACC rounds to 9.0%. The same WACC is used in all three scenarios: cyclicality and AI-capex risk are charged in the flows and the weights, not in the rate.",
